# hugmesh-headscale-oidc-defer — mesh control over Tor (OPT-IN): switch headscale's
# OIDC on once the issuer answers (docs/MESH-CONTROL-OVER-TOR.md). Staged at
# /etc/hugmesh/registry/cron-headscale-oidc-defer by the builder and copied here by
# keys-provision only on a pki node whose KEYS choose a Tor transport. A no-op once
# its marker is gone.
#
# Field order: min hour dom month dow user command
* * * * * root /usr/sbin/hugmesh-headscale-oidc-defer >> /var/log/hugmesh-headscale-oidc-defer.log 2>&1
